{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04976","headline":"江上有怀 · 王适","name":"江上有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湛湛江水见底清，荷花莲子傍江生。\n采莲将欲寄同心，秋风落花空复情。\n櫂歌数曲如有待，正见明月度东海。\n海上云尽月苍苍，万里分辉满洛阳。\n洛阳闺阁夜何央，蛾眉婵娟断人肠。\n寂寥金屏空自掩，青荧银烛不生光。\n应怜水宿洞庭子，今夕迢遥天一方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}